# Guardian Project Rules

## What this is
A unified AI caregiver system for a Veteran (Pops) with PTSD and Schizophrenia. Caregiver is Raymo. Jessica is the AI companion (Gemini). This is a real care system — correctness matters.

## Monorepo layout
```
artifacts/api-server/   Express 5 API
artifacts/brain-app/    React 19 + Vite 7 frontend
lib/api-spec/           openapi.yaml — source of truth for all API types
lib/api-client-react/   GENERATED — never hand-edit
lib/api-zod/            GENERATED — never hand-edit
lib/db/                 Drizzle ORM schema + PostgreSQL
lib/integrations-gemini-ai/  Gemini SDK wrapper
scripts/                seed.ts
```

## Hard rules — never break these

- `import { z } from "zod/v4"` — NOT `"zod"`. drizzle-zod requires the /v4 subpath.
- Never hand-edit files under `lib/api-client-react/src/generated/` or `lib/api-zod/src/generated/`.
- After editing `openapi.yaml`, always run codegen before typecheck: `pnpm --filter @workspace/api-spec run codegen`
- VaultProvider wraps all UI in App.tsx. Never add a page that bypasses `useVault().isUnlocked`.
- Haldol cycle day: `(diffDays % 14) + 1` — no Math.min/max clamping. Ever.
- `/scripts/active` must be registered before `/:id` in the Express router.
- `intercom_messages` stores ciphertext/iv/salt only — never plaintext. No server-side decryption.
- CORS is exact-match allowlist — do not relax to startsWith.
- Tenant scoping: derive tenant_id from `req.tenantSession.sub`, never from client-supplied fields.

## Dev commands
```bash
pnpm run typecheck                              # always run from root
pnpm --filter @workspace/api-spec run codegen  # after editing openapi.yaml
pnpm --filter @workspace/db run push           # push schema changes
pnpm --filter @workspace/api-server run dev    # start API
pnpm --filter @workspace/brain-app run dev     # start frontend
```

## Git / machine discipline
- One active writer at a time. Before editing: `git pull --rebase`. After: commit and push.
- Canonical remote: https://github.com/shadowsys-memphis/Guardian.git
- Never force push master. Never use LEDGERGHOST90 for this repo.
- Open the repo ROOT in Cursor — not artifacts/brain-app, not a subfolder.
- Run the proof block before any session: `pwd && git rev-parse --show-toplevel && git remote -v && git status --short`
